@startgantt
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
<style>
ganttDiagram {
  task { FontSize 15 }
  milestone { FontSize 15 }
  timeline { FontSize 14 }
}
</style>
language en
printscale weekly zoom 1.4
Label on first column and left aligned
[Sprint 0: Project definition and planning] as [S0] lasts 2 weeks
[Sprint 1: Requirements, UML and prototype] as [S1] lasts 2 weeks
[S1] starts at [S0]'s end
[Sprint 2: Database and Inventory module] as [S2] lasts 3 weeks
[S2] starts at [S1]'s end
[Sprint 3: Sales / Billing module] as [S3] lasts 3 weeks
[S3] starts at [S2]'s end
[Sprint 4: Supplier module] as [S4] lasts 2 weeks
[S4] starts at [S3]'s end
[Sprint 5: HR and CRM modules] as [S5] lasts 2 weeks
[S5] starts at [S4]'s end
[Sprint 6: Integration, testing and delivery] as [S6] lasts 2 weeks
[S6] starts at [S5]'s end
[Project definition approved] happens at [S0]'s end
[MVP demonstration] happens at [S3]'s end
[Final delivery] happens at [S6]'s end
@endgantt
